### 2. Backend API (FastAPI)

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///c:/Users/Администратор/Desktop/2/backend/main.py)
- Implement Auth System:
    - `POST /api/auth/google`: Verifies Google ID token, manages user session, returns JWT.
